# ── Go build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
terraform-provider-openinfra
terraform-provider-openinfra.exe
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
/bin/
/build/

# GoReleaser (release artifacts + checksums/signatures)
/dist/

# Go workspace / module scratch
go.work
go.work.sum

# ── Terraform ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local state, plans and provider caches from running examples/acceptance tests.
**/.terraform/*
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Variable files may hold cluster endpoints/credentials — never commit them.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# CLI config that can carry credentials / dev_overrides
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# ── Local dev / secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kubeconfigs and tokens used to talk to a cluster during development.
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# ── Editors / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
